cards.oracleText:
Gear Up, sponsored by Wizards of the Coast — As this Equipment enters, roll two six-sided dice. For each Magic-branded item you're wearing, roll an additional six-sided die. Choose two of those results.
Equipped creature gets +X/+Y, where X is the first chosen result and Y is the second.
Equip {4}

Equipped creature has trample.
Whenever equipped creature deals combat damage to a player, seek a card with mana value equal to that damage.
